  "scope": "Hosted I2C interrupt owner, planner-demand binding and channel-turn regression suite. Uses actual owner/controller/turn, planner/configuration/reset/byte adapters and runtime ring bodies with modeled MMIO/FIFO/clock and message syscall declarations. Includes 24 startup/wait failure scenarios, binding/vector/message matrix, original transfer/register/configuration/LPSS checks and composed channel lifecycle. No AML changes or ACPICA oracle are involved; these are transport tests.",
